CII-negative, SSEA4-negative, sca1-positive, Ter119-negative, and glycophorin A-negative. Cultured MSCs are capable of producing stem cell factor, IL7, IL8, IL11, TGF-beta, cofilin, galectin-1, laminin-receptor 1, cyclophilin A, and MMP-2.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_0000134 \"mesenchymal stem cell\")","truncated":true,"loaded":[]},"title":"src/ontology/cl-edit.owl","time":{"start":1778978011241,"end":1778978011478}},"id":"prt_e335a385f001JR8jFvE6WMvHBk","sessionID":"ses_1cca63944ffeC0p4p9EyTjkYHl","messageID":"msg_e335a16200011yUR2TJjuptbKH"}}
