{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778978130546,"sessionID":"ses_1cca63944ffeC0p4p9EyTjkYHl","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_iJw3EVUMpD0kA8Ah4E1NBHnG","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+Addressed in PR #<NN>.\n+\n+Added a new CL term for `fibrochondrocyte progenitor cell` with issue linkage, contributor ORCID, definition and abbreviation from the cited literature, and placement under existing progenitor/mesenchymal stem cell classes with fibrocartilage location and fibrochondrocyte lineage relation.\n*** Add File: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+Added a new term, `CL_9900001 fibrochondrocyte progenitor cell`, to `src/ontology/cl-edit.owl`.\n+\n+Rationale:\n+- Issue #3458 is a clear new term request.\n+- The cited paper `PMID:31871141` explicitly identifies fibrochondrocyte progenitors (FCP) in human meniscus by single-cell RNA-seq and functional assays.\n+- The cited paper `PMID:36338137` supports the broader meniscal progenitor characterization and differentiation potential.\n+- The ontology already contains `fibrochondrocyte` (`CL_4072104`), so I aligned the new term to that existing branch rather than introducing a separate pattern.\n+\n+What I changed:\n+- Added label: `fibrochondrocyte progenitor cell`.\n+- Added related synonym abbreviation: `FCP` with PMID support.\n+- Added a textual definition grounded in the request and literature, keeping it conservative and focused on properties directly supported by the papers.\n+- Added issue provenance with `IAO:0000233` pointing to issue `#3458`.\n+- Added the requestor ORCID as `terms:contributor`.\n+- Added required new-term metadata: `terms:creator` and `terms:date`.\n+- Placed the term under:\n+  - `CL_0000134` mesenchymal stem cell\n+  - `CL_0011026` progenitor cell\n+- Added fibrocartilage location using `BFO:0000050 some UBERON:0001995`.\n+- Added lineage relation `RO:0002203 some CL_4072104` to indicate development into fibrochondrocyte.\n+\n+Validation performed:\n+- Reviewed the imported issue context in `__issue_context__.json`.\n+- Checked the existing ontology for pre-existing fibrochondrocyte-related terms and nearby modeling patterns.\n+- Reviewed PubMed abstracts/full metadata for `PMID:31871141` and `PMID:36338137`.\n+- Ran `robot convert --input src/ontology/cl-edit.owl --output /tmp/opencode/cl-edit.ofn` to confirm ontology syntax after the edit.\n+\n+Checklist completed:\n+- [x] Confirmed the request was clear enough to implement.\n+- [x] Confirmed an exact term was not already present in `cl-edit.owl`.\n+- [x] Reused the existing fibrochondrocyte branch where possible.\n+- [x] Added required metadata for a new term.\n+- [x] Linked the term back to issue `#3458`.\n+- [x] Validated syntax with ROBOT.\n+- [x] Committed only the ontology file I edited.\n+\n+Commit created locally:\n+- `33c205f` `Add fibrochondrocyte progenitor cell`\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\nA PR_COMMENTS.md","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@\n+Addressed in PR #<NN>.\n+\n+Added a new CL term for `fibrochondrocyte progenitor cell` with issue linkage, contributor ORCID, definition and abbreviation from the cited literature, and placement under existing progenitor/mesenchymal stem cell classes with fibrocartilage location and fibrochondrocyte lineage relation.\n\nIndex: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 